<title>POLAND: VISCOPLAST TURNS TO PROFIT IN MAY.</title>
<headline>VISCOPLAST TURNS TO PROFIT IN MAY.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY			1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.47 vs   0.03 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.53 vs   0.06</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.39 vs   0.10</p>
<p> Sales		    4.38 vs   4.21</p>
<p> JANUARY-MAY	    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.35 vs   0.47</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.48 vs   0.93</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.85 vs   1.03</p>
<p> Sales		   21.65 vs  18.48</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish chemical firm is Viscoplast SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
